# ── Deploy helpers: LOCAL ONLY, never tracked ────────────────────────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC. Every one of these carries the VPS origin IP and SSH
# user, and two of them carry the password in plaintext. deploy_to_vps.bat and
# deploy_server_to_vps.bat were deleted from the remote on 2026-09-12, four days
# after the origin had to be locked to Cloudflare ranges because 82% of traffic
# was bypassing the CDN straight to the origin. A published origin IP is how that
# happens. They are ignored rather than deleted: they still work, they just must
# not leave this machine.
deploy_to_vps.bat
deploy_server_to_vps.bat
# Same reason: it hardcodes the origin IP. Rescued from commit ca4e2cf before the
# 2026-09-19 history scrub removed it; it is a useful read-only diagnostic, so it
# lives on disk rather than being lost.
tools/vps_audit.sh
